[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0118","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0280","title":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server SMTP EXPN 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server 3.3 的 SMTP 组件在处理 EXPN 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器的 25 端口发送超长 EXPN 命令参数触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，最终可在服务器上以 LocalSystem 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Mercur Mail Server 3.30 及更早版本，攻击无需任何认证，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0280"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Mercur Mail Server 至 3.30 以上版本，或安装厂商发布的安全补丁。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Postfix、Exchange），并在迁移前于防火墙层面限制 SMTP 端口（25/TCP）仅允许可信 IP 访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0413.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6027","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6149","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20647"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0112","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1442","title":"ISC INN innfeed 命令行缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"ISC INN 的 innfeed 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，版本低于 2.3.0 受影响。属于 news 组的本地用户可通过向 innfeed 传递超长的 -c 命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取提升的权限。该漏洞源于程序未对命令行参数长度进行充分校验，攻击者需具备本地 news 组访问权限方可利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1442"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-04-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:17Z","remediation":"升级 ISC INN 到 2.3.0 或更高版本以修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可限制 news 组用户的 innfeed 执行权限，或通过 sudo 规则禁止 news 组使用 -c 参数启动 innfeed。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0311.html","http://securitytracker.com/id?1001353","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/943536","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/178011","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2620","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6398","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20778","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1442.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2001/CVE-2001-1442.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/b5f1732ac1f4f69dada13f903e365a3a46ee1b07/2001/CVE-2001-1442/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1442","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2001/database/CVE-2001-1442/CVE-2001-1442-alt3kx.md","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2001/CVE-2001-1442.json","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/f28024448b3adaf04ff81cb923845fd5725692d0/2001/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wffw-62v7-rrv7/GHSA-wffw-62v7-rrv7.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1442.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2001/CVE-2001-1442","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2001-1442"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0524","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0524.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1325","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer/Outlook Express XML 样式表脚本执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0/5.5 及 Outlook Express 5.0/5.5 存在脚本执行绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在 XML 样式表（XSL）中嵌入恶意脚本，并利用 IFRAME 标签引用该样式表，从而在用户已禁用 Active Scripting 安全设置的情况下仍能执行任意脚本代码。该漏洞源于 Windows Scripting Host（WSH）对 XSL 样式表中脚本的处理缺陷，攻击者只需诱导用户访问特制网页即可触发，导致信息泄露、会话劫持或进一步恶意操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1325"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-04-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:02Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-005 提供的累积补丁（知识库编号 Q316059），该补丁适用于 Internet Explorer 5.01 SP2、5.5 SP1/SP2 及 6.0 Gold。安装后重启系统，并在 IE 的\"关于\"对话框中确认 Update Versions 字段显示 Q316059。如无法安装补丁，可将所有不受信任的网站加入受限站点区域，并在该区域中禁用\"运行 ActiveX 控件和插件\"及\"活动脚本\"；使用 Outlook 2002 或 Outlook Express 6 的用户应将 HTML 邮件设置为以纯文本格式打开以阻断邮件攻击向量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/3AE02004.57FDF958%40guninski.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2633","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6448","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20782","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1325.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1325.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1325","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1325.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1325.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms02-005.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-54x3-chv9-w529/GHSA-54x3-chv9-w529.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/iis_xss_404.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1325.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0524.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0524.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0523","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1400","title":"Linux kernel UDP 端口分配拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.19 之前版本中的 UDP 端口分配存在未知漏洞，本地用户可通过特制的 UDP 请求触发内核死锁，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 2.2.x 系列内核，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，无需高权限即可利用。由于 UDP 端口分配逻辑存在缺陷，多个并发 UDP 连接可能导致内核资源竞争，最终引发死锁，系统无法响应正常请求。Linux 社区已在 2.2.19 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1400"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-04-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本，该版本修复了 UDP 端口分配中的死锁问题。如无法升级内核，可通过限制本地用户对 UDP 端口的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98575345009963&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98637996127004&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98653252326445&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98684172109474&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98759029811377&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98775114228203&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99013830726309&w=2","http://www.linux.org.uk/VERSION/relnotes.2219.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-047.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-047","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1400.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1400.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1400","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1400.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1400.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3c98-cg94-53j7/GHSA-3c98-cg94-53j7.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88698/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--71935d76-5e7b-40b0-9784-35cec13ff018.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1400.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0523.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0522","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0522.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1399","title":"Linux Kernel x86架构用户访问汇编错误漏洞","description":"Linux 2.2.19 之前版本的内核在 x86 架构上存在用户空间访问汇编代码缺陷，部分内存操作函数复制了错误的字节数，导致内核内存被意外修改。本地攻击者可通过精心构造的系统调用触发该漏洞，实现内存越界写入，进而可能提升权限或导致系统崩溃。该漏洞影响所有使用 x86 架构的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1399"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-04-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本，该版本修复了 x86 架构用户空间访问汇编指令中字节数复制错误的问题。如无法立即升级内核，可限制本地用户对系统的交互式访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98575345009963&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98637996127004&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98653252326445&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98684172109474&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98759029811377&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98775114228203&w=2","http://marc.info/?