re":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1398"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-04-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本，该版本修复了 IP 伪装模块中数据包长度检查不完整的问题。如无法升级内核，可在防火墙上禁用 IP 伪装（MASQUERADE）功能，或限制伪装规则仅对可信源 IP 生效，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98575345009963&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98637996127004&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98653252326445&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98684172109474&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98759029811377&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98775114228203&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99013830726309&w=2","http://www.linux.org.uk/VERSION/relnotes.2219.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-047.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-047","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1398.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1398.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1398","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1398.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1398.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-896c-rvw7-9f9r/GHSA-896c-rvw7-9f9r.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89678/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1398.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ac03470f-de6