者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需额外认证即可触发，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。Linux 社区已在 2.2.19 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1395"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-04-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本，该版本修复了 sockfilter 在处理边界情况时的未知漏洞。如无法升级内核，可通过内核模块或 seccomp 策略限制 sockfilter 的调用权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98575345009963&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98637996127004&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98653252326445&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98684172109474&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98759029811377&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98775114228203&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99013830726309&w=2","http://www.linux.org.uk/VERSION/relnotes.2219.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-047.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-047","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1395.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1395.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1395","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1395.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1395.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-36pw-mfj6-c8q4/GHSA-36pw-mfj6-c8q4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89722/info.html","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-047.nasl","https://github.c