-2001-0512.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1392","title":"Linux Kernel CPUID 和 MSR 驱动未注册导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.19 之前版本中的 CPUID 和 MSR 驱动程序缺少正确的注销（unregister）调用，当用户反复加载和卸载这些驱动模块时，会导致内核资源管理混乱，进而引发系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞需要本地用户权限才能触发，攻击条件较为有限，影响范围覆盖所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统。利用方式为通过模块操作触发内核错误，无法实现远程攻击或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1392"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-04-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:10Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本，该版本已为 CPUID 和 MSR 驱动添加了正确的 unregister 调用，防止卸载重载时内核崩溃。如无法升级内核，可禁止卸载 CPUID 和 MSR 相关内核模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98575345009963&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98637996127004&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98653252326445&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98684172109474&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98759029811377&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98775114228203&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99013830726309&w=2","http://www.linux.org.uk/VERSION/relnotes.2219.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-047.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-047","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1392.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1392.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1392","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1392.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1392.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hqgx-5fv9-h958/GHSA-hqgx-5fv9-h958.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257