"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本（如 2.4.x 系列），或在内核配置中禁用 CONFIG_BINFMT_MISC 选项并重新编译内核。Debian 用户可应用 DSA-047 安全更新。若无法立即升级，可通过卸载 binfmt_misc 模块（modprobe -r binfmt_misc）或在 /proc/sys/fs/binfmt_misc/ 中移除注册的解释器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98575345009963&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98637996127004&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98653252326445&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98684172109474&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98759029811377&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98775114228203&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99013830726309&w=2","http://www.linux.org.uk/VERSION/relnotes.2219.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-047.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-047","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1390.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1390.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1390","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1390.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1390.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6h64-6636-w3w2/GHSA-6h64-6636-w3w2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89620/info.html","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-047.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1390.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--232f4521-d31b-4fd8-b59d-4dcaec2ccbd5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-1008","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-1008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0209","title":"Nullsoft Shoutcast DNAS 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Shoutcast Distributed Network Audio Server（DNAS）1.7.1 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送超长 description 字段的特制请求触发该漏洞，导致拒绝服务，并可能进一步执行任意命令。该漏洞影响部署 DNAS 1.7.1 的音频流媒体服务器，攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0209"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:53Z","remediation":"立即升级 Shoutcast DNAS 至 1.7.2 或更高版本以修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。如厂商不再提供旧版更新，建议通过防火墙规则限制对 DNAS 管理端口（默认 8000/tcp）的访问，仅允许可信来源 IP 连接，并部署入侵检测系统监控包含异常长 description 字段的恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0305.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5965","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0209.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0209.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0209","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0209.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0209.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0209.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b290a4630bf00bc86efda07bc07c03b933274d3f/2001/CVE-200